enjoying it and you know,

00:26:13.923 --> 00:26:15.380
it's still around and everything,

00:26:15.380 --> 00:26:16.700
but it's just like really fascinating

00:26:16.700 --> 00:26:20.390
how you can just make that as a living.

00:26:20.390 --> 00:26:22.100
- It goes into like the other
aspect of Japanese culture

00:26:22.100 --> 00:26:24.330
that is very prevalent where
they, they like predictability.

00:26:24.330 --> 00:26:26.202
They like the same thing.

00:26:26.202 --> 00:26:27.035
They want to know what's gonna happen

00:26:27.035 --> 00:26:28.390
