you would never be able to do

00:26:48.220 --> 00:26:49.600
in any other country or at least

00:26:49.600 --> 00:26:51.890
in any other country that I've lived in.

00:26:51.890 --> 00:26:55.130
Because that kind of business
model just wouldn't work.

00:26:55.130 --> 00:26:57.960
